	* src/roff/troff/input.cpp (file_iterator::close): Raise a
	ruckus on failed closure of a file stream or pipeline.  If basic
	operating system services are failing us, we want the user to
	know about it.  Throw error diagnostic if fclose(3) or pclose(3)
	fail.

